WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.467 --> 00:00:02.634
-Hey, guys, it is time
for our latest installment

00:00:02.634 --> 00:00:04.634
of "Tonight Show Polls."
Here we go.

00:00:04.634 --> 00:00:09.100
-♪ Tonight Show Polls ♪

00:00:09.100 --> 00:00:11.133
-These are polls.
Polls are very popular.

00:00:11.133 --> 00:00:12.934
-True, people love them.
-Yeah, people love them.

00:00:12.934 --> 00:00:14.367
Adults love them,
kids love them.

00:00:14.367 --> 00:00:16.434
-Everybody loves them --
grandpa, grandma.

00:00:16.434 --> 00:00:18.300
-Grandpa loves them?
-No.

00:00:18.300 --> 00:00:19.434
-No.
-He doesn't like them.

00:00:19.434 --> 00:00:20.634
-Yeah.
-He likes the poles more

00:00:20.634 --> 00:00:22.767
at the strip club.
[ Laughter ]

00:00:22.767 --> 00:00:23.934
-I wish -- I --

00:00:23.934 --> 00:00:26.634
[ Laughter ]

00:00:26.634 --> 00:00:28.734
I wish my grandma liked polls.

00:00:28.734 --> 00:00:30.634
-Why?
What's the matter?

00:00:30.634 --> 00:00:31.667
-Huh?

00:00:31.667 --> 00:00:34.434
-Why doesn't your grandma
like polls?

00:00:34.434 --> 00:00:36.033
She loves polls.
Every time I --

00:00:36.033 --> 00:00:37.767
Every time I go
to your grandma's house,

00:00:37.767 --> 00:00:40.501
it's like she goes --
she would read polls to me.

00:00:40.501 --> 00:00:42.167
-Sorry.
I hate to interrupt you.

00:00:42.167 --> 00:00:44.300
You didn't hear what happened?
-No.

00:00:44.300 --> 00:00:46.801
-Last -- Last Christmas.

00:00:46.801 --> 00:00:48.701
-Right.
-We're out at the house...

00:00:48.701 --> 00:00:50.300
-Yeah.
-...having some eggnog,

00:00:50.300 --> 00:00:51.634
stuff like that.

00:00:51.634 --> 00:00:53.834
I think she was probably is
medicated or something.

00:00:53.834 --> 00:00:55.634
-Well, she has a lot of meds,
sure, yeah.

00:00:55.634 --> 00:00:58.067
-Yeah, but she was wearing her
wig and everything, it was cute,

00:00:58.067 --> 00:00:59.801
to have her over there.
-Oh, she's funny.

00:00:59.801 --> 00:01:01.300
-Never mind. I don't even
want to talk about it.

00:01:01.300 --> 00:01:02.434
-What happened?
What happened?

00:01:02.434 --> 00:01:03.767
-What?
-What happened?

00:01:03.767 --> 00:01:05.567
-Well, it was Christmas Eve.

00:01:05.567 --> 00:01:08.667
And I don't know,
she was stumbling home.

00:01:08.667 --> 00:01:10.100
-Yeah?

00:01:10.100 --> 00:01:11.868
-And, uh, my grandma
got run over by a reindeer.

00:01:11.868 --> 00:01:13.534
-Oh, my God.
[ Laughter ]

00:01:13.534 --> 00:01:15.834
Where?

00:01:15.834 --> 00:01:17.634
-On the way to her house.

00:01:17.634 --> 00:01:18.934
-On Christmas Eve?

00:01:18.934 --> 00:01:20.934
-Yeah.
-Oh, my God.

00:01:20.934 --> 00:01:23.133
Did that shake your faith
in Christmas?

00:01:23.133 --> 00:01:24.801
-No, no,
me and grandpa still believe.

00:01:24.801 --> 00:01:27.434
[ Laughter ]

00:01:27.434 --> 00:01:29.267
Well, here we go.
This is polls now.

00:01:29.267 --> 00:01:31.667
-Polls, yeah.
-This first poll asks...

00:01:41.701 --> 00:01:42.734
-Oh, wow.

00:01:42.734 --> 00:01:44.701
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:01:44.701 --> 00:01:47.601
That's easily his favorite.
This next poll asks...

00:01:59.167 --> 00:02:03.501
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:02:03.501 --> 00:02:05.000
This next poll asks...

00:02:13.367 --> 00:02:16.000
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:02:16.000 --> 00:02:19.300
-"Hello."
-Next poll asks...

00:02:28.934 --> 00:02:31.467
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:02:31.467 --> 00:02:32.834
That's true.
It's the only one.

00:02:32.834 --> 00:02:34.467
That's the best.
That's the best one.

00:02:34.467 --> 00:02:36.400
-Fantastic bowl.
-This next poll asked...

00:02:46.434 --> 00:02:48.934
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:02:48.934 --> 00:02:50.767
This last one asked...

00:03:01.534 --> 00:03:03.100
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:03:03.100 --> 00:03:05.133
Well, that's all the time we
have for "Tonight Show Polls."

00:03:05.133 --> 00:03:07.334
When we come back,
we're playing "True Confessions"

00:03:07.334 --> 00:03:09.300
with Derek Jeter and Rita Ora.

00:03:09.300 --> 00:03:10.968
Come on back, everybody.

